sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as UI (React + Three.js)
    participant Worker as Web Worker (worker.js)
    participant Pyodide as Pyodide (Python WASM)
    participant Pipeline as Python Pipeline (ptt_*)

    User->>UI: Drop DXF file
    UI->>Worker: postMessage({cmd: "init"})
    Worker->>Pyodide: loadPyodide()
    Pyodide-->>Worker: Python ready
    Worker->>Pyodide: Load wheels (NumPy, NetworkX, Pydantic...)
    Pyodide-->>Worker: Packages loaded
    Worker-->>UI: {progress: "Ready"}

    UI->>Worker: postMessage({cmd: "parse", args: {bytes, filename}})
    Worker->>Pipeline: ptt_parser.parse_dxf(bytes)
    Pipeline-->>Worker: Plan JSON (walls, rooms)
    Worker-->>UI: {result: plan}

    UI->>Worker: postMessage({cmd: "build", args: {plan}})
    Worker->>Pipeline: ptt_shell.build(plan)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: ptt_furnish.furnish(plan)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: ptt_render.to_glb(scene)
    Pipeline-->>Worker: GLB file path
    Worker->>Worker: Read GLB from Pyodide FS
    Worker-->>UI: {result: GLB ArrayBuffer}

    UI->>UI: THREE.GLTFLoader.parse(GLB)
    UI->>UI: Setup scene, lights, shadows
    UI-->>User: 3D apartment rendered

    User->>UI: Click floor / WASD keys
    UI->>UI: Walker: collision check, move camera
    UI-->>User: Updated view

    User->>UI: Click "Tour" mode
    UI->>UI: Auto-tour: visit rooms sequentially
    UI-->>User: Animated walkthrough
